{
  "_comment": [
    "Drop into ~/.claude/settings.json (or merge with your existing config).",
    "Prefer generating this with acs-claude-code-wire, which validates hook coverage and",
    "warns when a subset of the ACS-Core minimum is wired. This file is the wire tool's",
    "output for the placeholder arguments below, as",
    "tests/integrations/claude_code/test_example_config.py asserts. Every setting rides",
    "inline in the command string, the only channel Claude Code passes to a command hook.",
    "",
    "Replace ACS_GUARDIAN_URL with your deployment's endpoint and the",
    "/path/to/ placeholders with real absolute paths.",
    "",
    "ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE: REQUIRED for ACS-Core baseline integrity (\u00a710), at least 32 bytes.",
    "ACS_HMAC_KEY_ID: REQUIRED with the secret. The label that names it; the Guardian holds the same one.",
    "Without a secret and its label every hook refuses its session and",
    "denies every step. Generate one:",
    "  mkdir -p ~/.acs && openssl rand -hex 32 > ~/.acs/hmac.key && chmod 600 ~/.acs/hmac.key",
    "and give the SAME file to the Guardian.",
    "",
    "ACS_AUDIT_FILE: where \u00a76.4 audit events land durably. Hook-process",
    "stderr is collected by nothing; this file is the audit half of the",
    "fail-open trade.",
    "",
    "ACS_DEFAULT_DENY=1 and onFailure block are set on the GATE hooks (PreToolUse,",
    "UserPromptSubmit), the ones whose verdict blocks an action. Observational hooks",
    "fail open per the \u00a76.4 default. Incident kill switch: set ACS_DISABLED=1 to",
    "bypass all hooks immediately."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "ACS_GUARDIAN_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787/acs ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE=/path/to/.acs/hmac.key ACS_HMAC_KEY_ID=2026-11 ACS_AUDIT_FILE=/path/to/.acs/audit.log /path/to/acs-claude-code-hook # acs-adapter-wired"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "ACS_GUARDIAN_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787/acs ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE=/path/to/.acs/hmac.key ACS_HMAC_KEY_ID=2026-11 ACS_DEFAULT_DENY=1 ACS_AUDIT_FILE=/path/to/.acs/audit.log /path/to/acs-claude-code-hook # acs-adapter-wired",
            "onFailure": "block"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "ACS_GUARDIAN_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787/acs ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE=/path/to/.acs/hmac.key ACS_HMAC_KEY_ID=2026-11 ACS_DEFAULT_DENY=1 ACS_AUDIT_FILE=/path/to/.acs/audit.log /path/to/acs-claude-code-hook # acs-adapter-wired",
            "onFailure": "block"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "ACS_GUARDIAN_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787/acs ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE=/path/to/.acs/hmac.key ACS_HMAC_KEY_ID=2026-11 ACS_AUDIT_FILE=/path/to/.acs/audit.log /path/to/acs-claude-code-hook # acs-adapter-wired"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUseFailure": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "ACS_GUARDIAN_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787/acs ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE=/path/to/.acs/hmac.key ACS_HMAC_KEY_ID=2026-11 ACS_AUDIT_FILE=/path/to/.acs/audit.log /path/to/acs-claude-code-hook # acs-adapter-wired"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "ACS_GUARDIAN_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787/acs ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE=/path/to/.acs/hmac.key ACS_HMAC_KEY_ID=2026-11 ACS_AUDIT_FILE=/path/to/.acs/audit.log /path/to/acs-claude-code-hook # acs-adapter-wired"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "ACS_GUARDIAN_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787/acs ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE=/path/to/.acs/hmac.key ACS_HMAC_KEY_ID=2026-11 ACS_AUDIT_FILE=/path/to/.acs/audit.log /path/to/acs-claude-code-hook # acs-adapter-wired"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "StopFailure": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "ACS_GUARDIAN_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787/acs ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE=/path/to/.acs/hmac.key ACS_HMAC_KEY_ID=2026-11 ACS_AUDIT_FILE=/path/to/.acs/audit.log /path/to/acs-claude-code-hook # acs-adapter-wired"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
